ind":"announcement","title":"Tiny Fortress Release Date!","summary":"Hello Tiny Fortress fans,I am happy to announce that Tiny Fortress officially has a release date:December 10, 2026(Less than two months away!)Mark your calendars, the incremental TD experience of a lifetime is finally at your doorstep =)From the devs,RKO & David Elliot","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T18:07:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685253","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4352900-1846651706679594","game_id":"steam-4352900","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Changes","summary":"Hello all,We updated our demo for the upcoming Steam Next Fest, including performance improvements, visual FX changes, and more.However, due to the nature of these changes the demo is different enough from before that your save file will not carry over. We apologize for the inconvenience. New players will be completely unaffected by these changes and should have a seamless experience.Thank you for understanding,Dave","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T23:38:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679594","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4352900-1839041357030750","game_id":"steam-4352900","kind":"announcement","title":"Renamed to TINY FORTRESS","summary":"Hello beloved players,Our game is now titled \"Tiny Fortress\".As a side note, you may have to uninstall, then re-install the Tiny Fortress demo in order to play it again.We recently were made aware of a trademark made by a mobile game company on a title that was very similar to ours. Because of this news, we have decided to change the title of our game to Tiny Fortress.Thank you for understanding, and our apologies for any inconvenience.Sincerely,RKO & David Elliot","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T21:13:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357030750","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4352900-1836506165576048","game_id":"steam-4352900","kind":"announcement","title":"Official Demo Released!","summary":"Hello everyone,The demo is officially out! What are you waiting for, go play it now!If you have played any previous iterations of our game, the demo has a lot of visual & thematic improvements, including a brief story intro, localization into Simplified Chinese & Russian (with more languages to come), revamped boss effects, new music, and more, while the core gameplay remains largely unchanged aside from a few balance adjustments.If you are playing on Steam Deck or gamepad, be sure to set your c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T14:12:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165576048","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4352900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:33Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:32Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4352900":"2026-10-26T12:08:33Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4352900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:32Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:32Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:32Z"},"4613880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:33Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:33Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:08:33Z"}},"context_snapshots":